{"id":"407f5075b4","t":"The Beloved Gardener of the World Tree","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/large_66743570e692ce0cd356ab271e8320046daed893_336_488_54776-193x278.webp","n":57,"l":57,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"the-beloved-gardener-of-the-world-tree"},"u":1795038245816,"desc":"ليليث لا نويلا، التي هاجرت من عالم آخر، تبذل قصارى جهدها لتجنب خطيبها، الدوق إدريون لا أركشاد، سبب وفاتها في القصة الأصلية. حتى أنها اختارت وظيفةً غير مرغوبة كبستانية في ريف الجنوب لتبتعد عنه قدر الإمكان. لكن هذا الخيار ينقلب عليها عندما تستدعي الإمبراطورة ليليث إلى العاصمة لتكليفها بمهمة شبه مستحيلة، وهي إزهار شجرة العالم. وإلا، ستُقتل عائلتها بأكملها. فهل ستنجو ليليث من نهاية مأساوية أخرى؟ وهل ستُزهر شيئًا آخر في هذه العملية؟","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["خيال علمى","دراما","رومانسى","شوجو"],"src":{"ml":"the-beloved-gardener-of-the-world-tree"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"the-beloved-gardener-of-the-world-tree|/manga/the-beloved-gardener-of-the-world-tree/1/"},"2":{"ml":"the-beloved-gardener-of-the-world-tree|/manga/the-beloved-gardener-of-the-world-tree/2/"},"3":{"ml":"the-beloved-gardener-of-the-world-tree|/manga/the-beloved-gardener-of-the-world-tree/3/"},"4":{"ml":"the-beloved-gardener-of-the-world-tree|/manga/the-beloved-gardener-of-the-world-tree/4/"},"5":{"ml":"the-beloved-gardener-of-the-world-tree|/manga/the-beloved-gardener-of-the-world-tree/5/"},"6":{"ml":"the-beloved-gardener-of-the-world-tree|/manga/the-beloved-gardener-of-the-world-tree/6/"},"7":{"ml":"the-beloved-gardener-of-the-world-tree|/manga/the-beloved-gardener-of-the-world-tree/7/"},"8":{"ml":"the-beloved-gardener-of-the-world-tree|/manga/the-beloved-gardener-of-the-world-tree/8/"},"9":{"ml":"the-beloved-gardener-of-the-world-tree|/manga/the-beloved-gardener-of-the-world-tree/9/"},"10":{"ml":"the-beloved-gardener-of-the-world-tree|/manga/the-beloved-gardener-of-the-world-tree/10/"},"11":{"ml":"the-beloved-gardener-of-the-world-tree|/manga/the-beloved-gardener-of-the-world-tree/11/"},"12":{"ml":"the-beloved-gard